            ht: ["Eksplike kontèks, mo ak lide yon pasaj", "Prepare plan, kesyon ak ilistrasyon", "Toujou verifye : IA pa yon otorite espirityèl", "Yon zouti ki eklere, pa ranplase ni etid ni lapriyè"],
            en: ["Explain context, words and ideas of a passage", "Prepare outlines, questions and illustrations", "Always verify: AI is not a spiritual authority", "A tool that lights up, replaces neither study nor prayer"],
