            ht: ["Ekri anons, mesaj byenvini, remèsiman", "Tradui pou yon kominote milti-lang (epi fè reli)", "Òganize : lòd du jou, planin, lide pòs", "Kenbe vwa ou : pèsonalize, otantisite soti nan ou"],
            en: ["Write announcements, welcome messages, thank-yous", "Translate for a multilingual community (then have it checked)", "Organise: agendas, schedules, post ideas", "Keep your voice: personalise, authenticity comes from you"],
